    "auditConfig": {
      "ignoreCves": [
        "CVE-2026-42338",
        "CVE-2026-69192",
        "CVE-2026-101913",
        "CVE-2026-101912",
        "CVE-2026-101911",
        "CVE-2026-97058"
      ]
    }
  },
  "x-audit-ignore-rationale": "ip-address/sprintf-js advisories reach us only via geoip-lite, which pins ip-address 5.8.9-5.9.4 (10.x is an API break). geoip-lite's bundled data is also ~2.7 years stale; the planned fix is to drop it in favour of Wazuh's own GeoLocation fields (CODE_REVIEW_2026-10-21.md Phase 3). Remove this block when geoip-lite is removed."
